#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS Storage Engine v10:
#      • planetary-scale multi-cluster federation
#      • inter-cluster routing
#      • cross-region and cross-planet repair
#      • unified XorRS hybrid parity
#      • global consistency fabric
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Planetary Federation](ca://s?q=Explain_Planetary_Federation)
#    - [Cluster Routing](ca://s?q=Explain_Cluster_Routing)
#    - [Latency Maps](ca://s?q=Explain_Latency_Maps)
